@TCR 39. See <Fire>.

@73[end]. A resplendence of light of a golden colour (then) inflowed through the roof...

@76[end]. Sparks of light from the Sun there descended... into their eyes, and through them into the habitations of their minds...

@136. (Five gymnasia seen which were circumfused with different kinds of light. Enumerated.) @459.

@137[end]. The tumult was stilled by light descending from Heaven... From these the light was seen to be thrown back, and to inflow into those who had passed from the left side to the right.

